Package: cli-ebook-reader
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Terminal-based EPUB ebook reader
 A command-line EPUB reader with a file browser interface built with ratatui
 and tui-file-explorer. Supports navigation, chapter selection, and
 keyboard-driven file exploration.